#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:5
#: af32fab3e6f849ed8ad73e9931579e64
msgid "Measuring Vibration"
msgstr "测量震动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:9
#: 62823d8484ff4a4d94f266a626a76df5
msgid ""
"Autopilots have accelerometers that are sensitive to vibrations. These "
"accelerometer values are combined with barometer and GPS data to estimate "
"the vehicle's position. With excessive vibrations, the estimate can be "
"thrown off and lead to very bad performance in modes that rely on accurate "
"positioning (e.g. on Copter: AltHold, Loiter, RTL, Guided, Position and Auto"
" flight modes)."
msgstr ""
"飞控具有对震动敏感的加速度计。这些加速度计数值与气压计和 GPS "
"数据结合，用于估算飞行器位置。震动过大时，估算可能出现偏差，导致依赖精确定位的飞行模式（例如 Copter 中的 "
"AltHold、Loiter、RTL、Guided、Position 和 Auto 飞行模式）性能极差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:16
#: ffdf486f6d434f6387731b8867c045f8
msgid ""
"These instructions explain how to measure the vibration levels. If you find "
"they are out-of-tolerance then follow the advice found on the "
":ref:`Vibration Damping <common-vibration-damping>` page."
msgstr ""
"这些说明解释了如何测量震动水平。如果发现超出容差范围，请参照 :ref:`震动抑制 <common-vibration-damping>` "
"页面上的建议进行处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:20
#: eeae1402a74a478ebbf8a835689515cb
msgid "Real-Time view in Ground Station"
msgstr "地面站实时显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:22
#: 2ef1abcc36684762a3ee7c6ffee93a12
msgid ""
"Ground Stations can display a real-time view of vibration and clipping.  If "
"using the Mission Planner click on \"Vibe\" on the HUD to display the "
"current vibration levels."
msgstr "地面站可以实时显示震动和削波情况。如果使用 Mission Planner，点击 HUD 上的「Vibe」可显示当前震动水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:28
#: 9720e3c15c9842d88edf0ae34b499821
msgid ""
"Vibration levels below 30m/s/s are normally acceptable.  Levels above "
"30m/s/s *may* have problems and levels above 60m/s/s nearly always have "
"problems with position or altitude hold."
msgstr ""
"震动水平低于 30m/s/s 通常是可以接受的。高于 30m/s/s *可能*会出现问题，高于 60m/s/s 几乎总是在位置或高度保持上有问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:31
#: 704a4619bfdb41f7a24883ec320199ec
msgid "Vibe Dataflash Log message"
msgstr "Vibe Dataflash 日志消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:33
#: 60dbced9bebb4028859b1a8d9e7e3813
msgid "Check the recorded Vibe levels are mostly below 30m/s/s"
msgstr "检查记录的 Vibe 水平是否大多低于 30m/s/s"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:35
#: b0d19da7de5c42b2a7aea6e10ab7a0ae
msgid ""
"Perform a regular flight (i.e. not just a gentle hover) of at least a few "
"minutes and :ref:`download the dataflash logs <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner_downloading_logs_via_mavlink>`."
msgstr ""
"进行至少几分钟的正常飞行（不仅仅是轻柔悬停）并 :ref:`下载 dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner_downloading_logs_via_mavlink>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:37
#: 14041684a20c4b6a80e79f50fd053c32
msgid ""
"Using the Mission Planner or other ground station graph the VIBE message's "
"VibeX, VibeY and VibeZ values.  These show the standard deviation of the "
"primary accelerometer's output in m/s/s.  The image below, taken from a 3DR "
"IRIS, shows normal levels which are below 15m/s/s but occasionally peak to "
"30m/s/s.  Maximum acceptable values appear to be below 30m/s/s (see second "
"picture below)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 或其他地面站绘制 VIBE 消息的 VibeX、VibeY 和 VibeZ "
"值图表。这些值显示主加速度计输出的标准差（单位 m/s/s）。下图摘自 3DR IRIS，显示正常水平——通常低于 15m/s/s，偶尔峰值至 "
"30m/s/s。可接受的最大值似乎低于 30m/s/s（见下方第二张图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:43
#: 8cae65ab39934cbb9b9367386de2df77
msgid ""
"Graph the Clip0, Clip1 and Clip2 values which increase each time one of the "
"accelerometers reaches its maximum limit (16G).  Ideally these should be "
"zero for the whole flight but low numbers (<100) are likely ok especially if"
" they occur during hard landings.  A regularly increasing number through the"
" log indicates a serious vibration problem that :ref:`should be fixed "
"<common-vibration-damping>`."
msgstr ""
"绘制 Clip0、Clip1 和 Clip2 "
"值图表，这些值在任一加速度计达到其最大限制（16G）时递增。理想情况下整个飞行过程中这些值应为零，但较小的数值（<100）可能是可以接受的，尤其是在硬着陆时发生。如果日志中该数值持续增加，则表明存在严重的震动问题，:ref:`应予以修复"
" <common-vibration-damping>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:54
#: 3798bf401fe348e8925df1f0b3be0a84
msgid ""
"This is an example of a vehicle that had position estimate problems due to "
"high vibrations."
msgstr "这是一个由于高震动导致位置估算出现问题的飞行器示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:61
#: 3b8ab3c662394fd8a645f55278590d62
msgid ""
"The algorithm for calculating the vibration levels can be seen in the "
"`AP_InertialSensor.cpp's calc_vibration_and_clipping() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_InertialSensor/AP_InertialSensor.cpp#L1609>`__"
" method but in short it involves calculating the standard deviation of the "
"accelerometer readings like this:"
msgstr ""
"计算震动水平的算法可以在 `AP_InertialSensor.cpp 的 calc_vibration_and_clipping() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_InertialSensor/AP_InertialSensor.cpp#L1609>`__"
" 方法中查看，简而言之是计算加速度计读数的标准差："

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:66
#: 9ef359898f7b4fa592250d97c26765a8
msgid "Capture the raw x, y and z accelerometer values from the primary IMU"
msgstr "从主 IMU 采集原始 x、y 和 z 加速度计值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:67
#: 48c954c8b3ea446790826b87bc3b2c53
msgid ""
"High-pass filter the raw values at 5hz to remove the vehicle's movement and "
"create a \"accel_vibe_floor\" for x,y and z axis."
msgstr "对原始值进行 5Hz 高通滤波，去除飞行器运动，为 x、y 和 z 轴创建「accel_vibe_floor」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:69
#: c0b294eaea6d412fb8b53f4db1fa5cb4
msgid ""
"Calculate the difference between the latest accel values and the "
"accel_vibe_floor."
msgstr "计算最新加速度计值与 accel_vibe_floor 之间的差值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:71
#: cb18cb9d9f204983bbbc30f006653d13
msgid ""
"Square the above differences, filter at 2hz and then calculate the square "
"root (for x, y and z).  These final three values are what appear in the VIBE"
" msg's VibeX, Y and Z fields."
msgstr ""
"对上述差值求平方，以 2Hz 滤波后再计算平方根（对 x、y 和 z 分别计算）。这三个最终值即显示在 VIBE 消息的 VibeX、Y 和 Z "
"字段中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:75
#: eae578a0456f4b24878bb800a0672240
msgid ""
"When looking at vibrations in a log the first thing to look at is the "
"clipping. If the clipping is 0 that’s good. That means the vibrations that "
"are being detected aren’t overwhelming the IMU."
msgstr "查看日志中的震动时，首先应查看削波情况。如果削波为 0，说明情况良好，即检测到的震动没有使 IMU 过载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:77
#: 4610102700c74694ac4d0aca1cc979c6
msgid ""
"When troubleshooting the vibration, consider the axis of the vibration as a "
"staring point to find the problem:"
msgstr "排查震动问题时，将震动轴作为查找问题的起点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:79
#: f1ff8ab192454a1fbef593c3939421ef
msgid ""
"If X AND Y are both high, then you may have an issue with a motor bearing or"
" prop balance. Or you may need more/better overall vibration damping for "
"your FC. If X OR Y is high then you may have an issue with your FC mounting."
" Maybe a wire is bouncing on the FC or restraining it. Or maybe your "
"vibration damping works better in one axis than the other. If you have a Z "
"vibration then you may have a track issue with propeller (bent blade) or "
"vertical play in a motor."
msgstr ""
"如果 X 和 Y 同时偏高，可能是电机轴承或螺旋桨平衡问题，或者飞控需要更好/更多的整体震动阻尼。如果 X 或 Y "
"单独偏高，可能是飞控安装问题——也许有导线弹振到飞控上或对其产生束缚，或者震动阻尼在某一轴上效果更好。如果 Z "
"轴震动偏高，可能是螺旋桨轨迹问题（桨叶弯曲）或电机垂直方向有间隙。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:83
#: 747b1779dc62438198f72404a38e5934
msgid ""
"Also consider that some flight conditions/airframes will have different "
"natural vibrations. If the vibrations look good in a hover, but they "
"increase with speed, perhaps there is an aerodynamic issue with the "
"airframe, or in wind,"
msgstr ""
"还需考虑某些飞行条件/机架在不同状态下可能有不同的自然震动。如果悬停时震动良好，但随速度增加震动也增大，可能是机架的空气动力学问题，或者是风中的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:86
#: 80b814f49e8b4ec6bde0c7ae5c08ae1f
msgid "Looking for \"The Leans\""
msgstr "寻找「偏斜」现象"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:88
#: 65f3a8a0343c4542af354098b2998ecc
msgid ""
"**The Leans** occurs when the vehicle's attitude estimate becomes incorrect "
"causing it to lean significantly even though the pilot is commanding level "
"flight.  The cause of the problem is often accelerometer aliasing which can "
"be confirmed by comparing the Roll and Pitch attitude estimates from each of"
" the estimation systems (i.e. each AHRSs or EKFs).  The attitude estimates "
"should be within a few degrees of each other"
msgstr ""
"**偏斜** 是指飞行器的姿态估算出现错误，即使飞手命令水平飞行，飞行器也会明显倾斜。问题的原因通常是加速度计混叠，可以通过比较各估算系统（即各 "
"AHRS 或 EKF）的横滚和俯仰姿态估算来确认。各姿态估算之间的差异应在几度以内"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:90
#: 7d0ac92862fc499195dde590fd0c7c9f
msgid "Download the dataflash log and open in the ground station's log viewer"
msgstr "下载 dataflash 日志并在地面站的日志查看器中打开"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:91
#: be2c117924f5450488d8b2dd217a806c
msgid ""
"Compare the AHRS2.Roll, NKF1[0].Roll and NKF1[1].Roll if using EKF2, or "
"AHRS2.Roll, XKF1[0].Roll and XKF1[1].Roll, if using EKF3"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 EKF2，比较 AHRS2.Roll、NKF1[0].Roll 和 NKF1[1].Roll；如果使用 EKF3，比较 "
"AHRS2.Roll、XKF1[0].Roll 和 XKF1[1].Roll"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:93
#: 504662291e024262a7cc29df61f30bcf
msgid "The image below shows a typical log in which the attitudes match well"
msgstr "下图显示了一个姿态匹配良好的典型日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:100
#: ba101ac664564a8dad818ee7b2def8c3
msgid "Advanced Analysis with FFT"
msgstr "使用 FFT 进行高级分析"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:102
#: 7dce4815a6374637ac4b71c787d6cdf8
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`Measuring Vibration with \"Raw IMU Logging\" <common-raw-"
"imu-logging>` page for instructions on how to collect large amounts of IMU "
"data and perform an FFT analysis to determine the frequencies with the most "
"vibration."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`使用「原始 IMU 记录」测量震动 <common-raw-imu-logging>` 页面，了解如何采集大量 IMU 数据并进行 "
"FFT 分析以确定震动最强的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:105
#: f16369a392c24aab92aa16547068036d
msgid "IMU Dataflash Log message"
msgstr "IMU Dataflash 日志消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:107
#: 6c286f0e478c40bf93a6a4ec968e293f
msgid ""
"For very old versions of ArduPilot that do not include the Vibe message the "
"IMU values can be checked directly"
msgstr "对于不包含 Vibe 消息的旧版 ArduPilot，可以直接检查 IMU 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:109
#: 4aca469b85384354b971bb68dff2a9b3
msgid ""
"Ensure the :ref:`LOG_BITMASK <LOG_BITMASK>` parameter is set to include IMU "
"data so accelerometer values are recorded to the dataflash logs"
msgstr ""
"确保 :ref:`LOG_BITMASK <LOG_BITMASK>` 参数设置为包含 IMU 数据，以便将加速度计值记录到 dataflash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:110
#: 6980a1f080cc4a5ca8ac0480fd799b85
msgid ""
"Fly your copter in Stabilize mode and try to maintain a level hover (it "
"doesn't need to be perfectly stable or level)"
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下飞行，并尽量保持水平悬停（不需要非常稳定或完全水平）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:111
#: 7f8920cf21e64f2686dd3222b009e6ed
msgid ""
":ref:`Download the dataflash logs and <common-downloading-and-analyzing-"
"data-logs-in-mission-planner_downloading_logs_via_mavlink>` after the "
"download has completed, use the Mission Planner's \"Review a Log\" button to"
" open the latest file in the log directory (it's last digit will be the Log "
"number you downloaded so in the example above we downloaded Log #1 so the "
"filename will end in 1.log)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`下载 dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner_downloading_logs_via_mavlink>` 后，使用 Mission Planner "
"的「查看日志」按钮打开日志目录中的最新文件（文件名末尾的数字即为您下载的日志编号，例如上述示例中下载了日志 #1，文件名将以 1.log 结尾）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:116
#: 95a6764598b14819aa5faafb0fad518c
msgid ""
"When the Log Browser appears, scroll down until you find any IMU message.  "
"Click on the row's AccX and push **Graph this data** Left button.  Repeat "
"for the AccY and AccZ columns to produce a graph like below."
msgstr ""
"当日志浏览器出现时，向下滚动直到找到任意 IMU 消息。点击该行的 AccX 列并按 **绘制此数据** 左键。对 AccY 和 AccZ "
"列重复此操作，生成如下图所示的图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:121
#: c599c32361c64370b65c9c2e8e03851f
msgid "|DiagnosingWithLogs_Vibes|"
msgstr "|DiagnosingWithLogs_Vibes|"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst
#: 78ef66ce05c84541b94d02e0a96d9007
msgid "DiagnosingWithLogs_Vibes"
msgstr "DiagnosingWithLogs_Vibes"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:123
#: ac0264d33ee44c28ac2938ce060da77c
msgid ""
"Check the scale on the left and ensure that your vibration levels for the "
"AccX and AccY are between -3 and +3.  For AccZ the acceptable range is -15 "
"to -5.  If it is very close or over these limits you should refer back to "
"the :ref:`Vibration Damping <common-vibration-damping>` page for possible "
"solutions."
msgstr ""
"检查左侧刻度，确保 AccX 和 AccY 的震动水平在 -3 到 +3 之间。AccZ 的可接受范围是 -15 到 "
"-5。如果非常接近或超过这些限制，应参阅 :ref:`震动阻尼 <common-vibration-damping>` 页面了解可能的解决方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-measuring-vibration.rst:127
#: 2e8d26feb28a40578f03e77c9ef54543
msgid ""
"After all the above is complete, go to the Mission Planner's standard "
"parameters page (you may need to press the **Connect** button again) and set"
" the Log Bitmask back to \"Default\".  This is important because especially "
"on the APM logging requires significant CPU resources and it's a waste to "
"log these if they're not really needed."
msgstr ""
"完成上述所有操作后，转到 Mission Planner 的标准参数页面（可能需要再次按 **连接** "
"按钮）并将日志位掩码设置回「默认」。这一点很重要，因为尤其是在 APM 上，记录日志需要大量 CPU 资源，如果不是真正需要，记录这些数据是浪费资源。"
